#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/private_keys.rst:4
msgid "Private Key Management"
msgstr "Privado Clave Management"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/private_keys.rst:7
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Descripción general"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/private_keys.rst:9
msgid ""
"|morpheus| securely stores and manages private keys associated with "
"SSL/TLS certificates. Private keys are encrypted at rest and access is "
"controlled through role-based permissions. This section covers best "
"practices and operational procedures for key management within "
"|morpheus|."
msgstr ""
"|morpheus| securely stores y gestiona privado claves asociado con SSL/TLS"
" certificados. Privado claves son encrypted en rest y acceso es "
"controlled a través de role-based permisos. Este sección covers mejores "
"prácticas y operational procedures para clave gestión dentro de "
"|morpheus|."

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/private_keys.rst:12
msgid "Key Storage Security"
msgstr "Clave Storage Security"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/private_keys.rst:14
msgid ""
"All private keys stored in |morpheus| are protected by multiple layers of"
" security:"
msgstr ""
"Todos privado claves stored en |morpheus| son protected por múltiples "
"layers de security:"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/private_keys.rst:16
msgid ""
"**Encryption at Rest:** Keys are stored using AES-256 encryption in the "
"|morpheus| database"
msgstr ""
"**Cifrado at Rest:** Keys son stored usando AES-256 cifrado en el "
"|morpheus| base de datos"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/private_keys.rst:17
msgid ""
"**Access Control:** Only users with the appropriate role permissions can "
"view or manage certificates containing private keys"
msgstr ""
"**Acceso Control:** Solo usuarios con el appropriate permisos de rol "
"puede ver o manage certificados containing privado claves"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/private_keys.rst:18
msgid ""
"**Masked Display:** Private keys are never displayed in plain text in the"
" UI after upload"
msgstr ""
"**Masked Display:** Privado claves son nunca mostrado en plain text en el"
" UI después de cargar"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/private_keys.rst:19
msgid ""
"**Audit Trail:** Key access and modifications are logged in the "
"|morpheus| activity feed"
msgstr ""
"**Audit Trail:** Clave acceso y modifications son logged en el |morpheus|"
" activity feed"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/private_keys.rst:22
msgid "Supported Key Types"
msgstr "Supported Clave Tipos"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/private_keys.rst:24
msgid "|morpheus| supports the following private key formats:"
msgstr "|morpheus| soporta lo siguiente privado clave formats:"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/private_keys.rst:26
msgid "**RSA:** 2048-bit and 4096-bit RSA keys (most common)"
msgstr "**RSA:** 2048-bit y 4096-bit RSA claves (más común)"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/private_keys.rst:27
msgid "**ECDSA:** Elliptic Curve keys (P-256, P-384, P-521)"
msgstr "**ECDSA:** Elliptic Curve claves (P-256, P-384, P-521)"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/private_keys.rst:28
msgid ""
"**PEM Format:** Base64-encoded DER format enclosed in ``-----BEGIN "
"PRIVATE KEY-----`` / ``-----END PRIVATE KEY-----`` headers"
msgstr ""
"**PEM Format:** Base64-encoded DER format enclosed en ``-----BEGIN "
"PRIVATE KEY-----`` / ``-----END PRIVATE KEY-----`` headers"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/private_keys.rst:31
msgid "Key Passphrases"
msgstr "Clave Passphrases"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/private_keys.rst:33
msgid "|morpheus| supports passphrase-protected private keys:"
msgstr "|morpheus| soporta passphrase-protected privado claves:"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/private_keys.rst:35
msgid ""
"When uploading a key with a passphrase, enter the passphrase in the **KEY"
" PASSPHRASE** field"
msgstr ""
"Cuando uploading un clave con un passphrase, ingresar el passphrase en el"
" **KEY PASSPHRASE** campo"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/private_keys.rst:36
msgid "The passphrase is stored encrypted alongside the key"
msgstr "El passphrase es stored encrypted alongside el clave"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/private_keys.rst:37
msgid ""
"|morpheus| automatically decrypts the key when needed for operations "
"(e.g., SSL termination)"
msgstr ""
"|morpheus| automáticamente decrypts el clave cuando necesario para "
"operaciones (e.g., SSL termination)"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/private_keys.rst:39
msgid "Note"
msgstr "Nota"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/private_keys.rst:39
msgid ""
"It is recommended to use passphrase-protected keys for an additional "
"layer of security, particularly when keys are shared across multiple "
"systems."
msgstr ""
"It es recomendado a usar passphrase-protected claves para un adicional "
"layer de security, particularly cuando claves son shared a través de "
"múltiples sistemas."

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/private_keys.rst:42
msgid "Uploading Private Keys"
msgstr "Uploading Privado Keys"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/private_keys.rst:44
msgid "Private keys are uploaded as part of a certificate record:"
msgstr "Privado claves son uploaded como part de un certificado record:"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/private_keys.rst:46
msgid "Navigate to |InfTruCer|"
msgstr "Navegue un |InfTruCer|"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/private_keys.rst:47
msgid "Click :guilabel:`+ ADD` or edit an existing certificate"
msgstr "Click :guilabel:`+ AGREGAR` o editar un existente certificado"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/private_keys.rst:48
msgid ""
"In the **PRIVATE KEY (PEM)** field, paste the full PEM-encoded private "
"key content"
msgstr ""
"En el **PRIVATE KEY (PEM)** campo, paste el completo PEM-encoded privado "
"clave content"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/private_keys.rst:49
msgid ""
"If the key is passphrase-protected, enter the passphrase in the **KEY "
"PASSPHRASE** field"
msgstr ""
"Si el clave es passphrase-protected, ingresar el passphrase en el **KEY "
"PASSPHRASE** campo"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/private_keys.rst:50
msgid "Click :guilabel:`SAVE`"
msgstr "Click :guilabel:`SAVE`"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/private_keys.rst:53
msgid "Key Rotation"
msgstr "Clave Rotation"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/private_keys.rst:55
msgid "To rotate a private key (e.g., for security compliance):"
msgstr "A rotate un privado clave (e.g., para security compliance):"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/private_keys.rst:57
msgid ""
"Generate a new key pair and obtain a new certificate signed with the new "
"key"
msgstr ""
"Generate un nuevo clave pair y obtain un nuevo certificado signed con el "
"nuevo clave"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/private_keys.rst:58
msgid "Edit the existing certificate record in |morpheus|"
msgstr "Editar el existente certificado record en |morpheus|"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/private_keys.rst:59
msgid "Replace the certificate content and private key with the new values"
msgstr "Replace el certificado content y privado clave con el nuevo valores"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/private_keys.rst:60
msgid "Save the updated record"
msgstr "Guardar el actualizado record"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/private_keys.rst:61
msgid "Verify services using the certificate continue to function correctly"
msgstr "Verificar servicios usando el certificado continuar a function correctly"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/private_keys.rst:63
msgid "Tip"
msgstr "Consejo"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/private_keys.rst:63
msgid ""
"For zero-downtime key rotation on load balancers, add the new certificate"
" as a separate entry first, update the load balancer configuration to use"
" the new certificate, then remove the old entry."
msgstr ""
"Para zero-downtime clave rotation en load balancers, agregar el nuevo "
"certificado como un separate entrada primero, update el load balancer "
"configuración a usar el nuevo certificado, entonces eliminar el antiguo "
"entrada."

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/private_keys.rst:66
msgid "Key Export Restrictions"
msgstr "Clave Export Restrictions"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/private_keys.rst:68
msgid ""
"By design, |morpheus| does not provide a mechanism to export or download "
"private keys once uploaded. This is a security measure to prevent "
"unauthorized key extraction. If a private key is needed outside of "
"|morpheus|, it must be retrieved from the original source or regenerated."
msgstr ""
"Por design, |morpheus| does no proporcionar un mechanism a export o "
"descargar privado claves once uploaded. Este es un security measure a "
"prevent unauthorized clave extraction. Si un privado clave es necesario "
"outside de |morpheus|, it debe be retrieved desde el original origen o "
"regenerated."

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/private_keys.rst:71
msgid "SSH Key Pairs"
msgstr "SSH Clave Pairs"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/private_keys.rst:73
msgid ""
"SSH key pairs for server authentication are managed separately in the "
"**Key Pairs** section of Infrastructure > Trust. See the Key Pairs "
"documentation for details on managing SSH keys used during provisioning."
msgstr ""
"SSH clave pairs para servidor autenticación son administrado "
"separadamente en el **Pares de claves** sección de Infraestructura > "
"Trust. Consulte la Pares de claves documentación para details en managing"
" SSH claves utilizado durante provisioning."

